<p> <strong>Repaint or Stain the Fence</strong> – A fresh coat makes an old fence <strong>look brand new</strong>.<br> <strong>Repair Loose or Broken Sections</strong> – Fixing small issues prevents bigger problems later.<br> <strong>Add Climbing Plants or Hanging Decor</strong> – Ivy or string lights create an inviting look.</p>
